		{
			"identifier": "SurfaceLoop",
			"uid": 6818,
			"tags": ["Loop"],
			"exportToToc": false,
			"allowOutOfBounds": true,
			"doc": "A rideable full loop. The box IS the loop's circle: its centre is the loop centre and half its side the radius, so draw a bigger box for a bigger loop. With attach_to naming a floor chain (or 'terrain', the painted floor under it) it is a runnable loop built where the box is, its ramp climbing from the floor to the circle's bottom; otherwise a closed rideable ring of `segments` sides.",
